                <head>Organization of a new International Financial Consortium<anchor n="33"
                        xml:id="ch24-f1"/></head>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p rendition="#flush">Tentative Definition by the American Group of the Scope of
                        the Consortium’s Activities—Formation of an Advisory Council of the
                        Consortium—Suggestion by the Department of State that the American Group
